to you, Scrooge,

567
00:35:18.434 --> 00:35:20.799
but you can't change anything.

568
00:35:56.641 --> 00:35:58.205
<i>Are these the shadows</i>

569
00:35:58.341 --> 00:36:00.170
<i>of things that must be?</i>

570
00:36:00.306 --> 00:36:02.980
<i>Or are they only shadows
of things that might be?</i>

571
