658
00:43:19.082 --> 00:43:20.796
<i>Please have all tickets ready.</i>

659
00:43:20.820 --> 00:43:22.020
<i>This is Metro North
to North...</i>

660
00:43:22.152 --> 00:43:23.595
<i>Hey, what are you doing?</i>

661
00:43:23.619 --> 00:43:24.619
