697
00:45:17.036 --> 00:45:18.771
- What good is science?
- Okay, enough.

698
00:45:18.795 --> 00:45:20.407
- Please, don't fight.
- Enough.

699
00:45:20.431 --> 00:45:21.609
No, I was just telling them...

700
00:45:21.633 --> 00:45:23.765
Enough! Your voices
