736
00:46:36.840 --> 00:46:38.426
What? That's...
But you guys...

737
00:46:38.450 --> 00:46:39.607
What about them?

738
00:46:39.743 --> 00:46:40.963
And he was crawling
on the ceiling.

739
00:46:40.987 --> 00:46:43.486
What about that guy?
I mean, you saw. I...

740
00:46:43.622 --> 00:46:44.622
No one saw ceiling guy.

741
