what actually happened.

758
00:47:21.357 --> 00:47:23.192
Okay, well, this is what
we're gonna do, okay?

759
00:47:23.327 --> 00:47:26.227
We're just gonna, like,
lay low for a little bit.

760
00:47:27.158 --> 00:47:28.766
And, um...

761
00:47:28.902 --> 00:47:30.429
