how to get out of this.

762
00:47:37.570 --> 00:47:39.100
This is still
not a kidnapping.

763
00:47:39.235 --> 00:47:40.274
Okay?

764
00:47:41.614 --> 00:47:43.310
Feels like a kidnapping.

765
00:47:45.983 --> 00:47:47.477
How'd they get away?

766
00:47:47.613 --> 00:47:49.417
It's like they knew
