there aren't any cameras.

770
00:47:55.889 --> 00:47:57.920
<i>The police don't have
this technology.</i>

771
00:47:58.055 --> 00:48:01.127
<i>You have access
to every camera in the city.</i>

772
00:48:01.262 --> 00:48:02.462
<i>We should be ahead of them.</i>

773
00:48:02.597 --> 00:48:06.194
